{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_06_class_03_private_elements_private_elements", "label": "Private elements", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/06-class/03-private-elements.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The one class feature with no desugaring. # prefix; privacy enforced by JavaScript itself, in the grammar."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_06_class_03_private_elements_private_syntaxerror", "label": "Private access SyntaxError outside class", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/06-class/03-private-elements.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "obj.#field outside the declaring class is a parse-time SyntaxError, so the file never runs. Not equivalent to _underscore."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_06_class_03_private_elements_private_typeerror", "label": "Private access TypeError on wrong object", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/06-class/03-private-elements.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Inside the class, access on a non-instance throws TypeError: Cannot read private member #x from an object whose class did not declare it."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_06_class_03_private_elements_brand_check", "label": "#x in obj brand check", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/06-class/03-private-elements.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Asks whether the object has that private element without throwing. Stronger than instanceof because privates cannot be forged or added later."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_06_class_03_private_elements_private_not_inherited", "label": "Private elements are not inherited", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/06-class/03-private-elements.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Not part of the prototypical inheritance model. A subclass cannot read the parent's #field. JS has no protected. Same name in parent and child are independent slots."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_06_class_03_private_elements_private_unique_namespace", "label": "Private identifier unique namespace", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/06-class/03-private-elements.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "All private identifiers in a class must be unique; namespace shared between static and instance. Only get/set pairs may repeat. #constructor is reserved."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_06_class_03_private_elements_private_not_security", "label": "Private elements are encapsulation not security", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/06-class/03-private-elements.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A debugger shows them. Guarantee is that other code cannot accidentally depend on internals \u2014 a maintenance property, not secrecy."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_06_class_03_private_elements_private_not_serialisable", "label": "Private elements are not serialisable", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/06-class/03-private-elements.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "JSON.stringify cannot see them; structuredClone does not duplicate them. A class with private state needs its own toJSON and clone."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_06_class_03_private_elements_page", "label": "06.3 \u00b7 Private elements", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/06-class/03-private-elements.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_06_class_03_private_elements_page", "target": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_06_class_03_private_elements_private_elements", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/06-class/03-private-elements.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_06_class_03_private_elements_page", "target": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_06_class_03_private_elements_private_syntaxerror", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/06-class/03-private-elements.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_06_class_03_private_elements_page", "target": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_06_class_03_private_elements_private_typeerror", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/06-class/03-private-elements.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_javascript_pages_